							"elements": []
						},
						{
							"id": "e6a6676",
							"elType": "widget",
							"widgetType": "text-editor",
							"settings": {
								"editor": "<p>The most expensive room in Laos is rarely the best one. Some of the finest places to stay here have twelve rooms and no spa, and the reason to choose them is where they are and how quiet they are at six in the morning.</p>\n<p>What genuinely costs money, and is genuinely worth it, is privacy and time — a boat that is yours for the day, a guide who is not watching the clock, and a schedule loose enough to change.</p>",
								"_css_classes": "bt-landing-insight__body"
							},
							"elements": []
						},
						{
							"id": "5fedd36",
							"elType": "widget",
							"widgetType": "text-editor",
							"settings": {
								"editor": "<p>Ken FJ Her — founder, Brother Tours. Licensed Lao National Tour Guide since 2010; founded Brother Tours in 2018.</p>",
								"_css_classes": "bt-landing-insight__attribution"
							},
							"elements": []
						}
